  "body": "Thoughtfully designed to embrace a relaxed coastal lifestyle, this architecturally designed single-level residence offers an outstanding combination of generous space, flexible living, and everyday comfort. Positioned on an approximately 732sqm corner section, with a spacious 237sqm (approx.) floor area, the home is designed to feature three bedrooms, two bathrooms, two living areas, a dedicated study, and a double internal-access garage, creating an ideal setting for modern family living.\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\nThe spacious open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area forms the heart of the home, providing a welcoming setting for everyday family life and effortless entertaining.\r\nThe contemporary kitchen features a generous walk-in pantry, providing excellent storage while keeping the main kitchen neatly organised and functional.\r\nThe main living spaces extend onto expansive northwest-facing decks, capturing beautiful coastal views and creating a natural connection between indoor and outdoor living.\r\nA separate lounge provides an additional living space, making it ideal for family movie nights, entertaining guests, or simply enjoying some quiet time away from the main living area.\r\nPrivately positioned, the generous master suite enjoys beautiful west-facing ocean views and features its own ensuite, offering a peaceful retreat at the end of the day.\r\nTwo additional well-proportioned bedrooms are thoughtfully positioned away from the master suite and are serviced by a well-designed family bathroom arrangement, with a separate toilet room and a dedicated bathroom featuring both a shower and bathtub.\r\nA dedicated study room offers a practical space for working from home, studying, or managing everyday tasks without interrupting the main living areas.\r\nA separate laundry room and a double internal-access garage add everyday convenience, while two additional outdoor parking spaces provide further flexibility for family members and visiting guests.\r\nSet within the sought-after Hobbs Bay Estate in Gulf Harbour, the property offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy life by the coast. With direct beach access, scenic walking trails, communal green spaces, and a children's playground, the surrounding community provides plenty of opportunities for outdoor recreation. Gulf Harbour School, Wentworth Primary, and local amenities are all within easy reach, while the future Penlink connection is expected to further improve accessibility to the wider Auckland region.\r\nContact us today to find out more about this exceptional coastal home.",
